      "https://fox29.com/news/ship-seized-after-1-3-billion-cocaine-bust-at-philadelphia-port",
      "https://www.npr.org/2019/07/09/739761916/federal-agents-seize-cargo-ship-linked-to-massive-cocaine-bust-in-philadelphia",
      "https://cbsnews.com/philadelphia/news/msc-gayane-seized-cocaine-bust-philadelphia"
     ]
    },
    {
     "claim": "K_crane",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "Prosecutors say crew members loaded bulk packages of cocaine onto the ship at sea from speedboats that approached in the middle of the night, hoisted the cargo nets aboard with the ship's crane, hid the drugs among legitimate cargo in containers and resealed them with fake seals. Narration: 'Its own crew craned it up from speedboats.' Callout 'THE SHIP'S OWN CRANE'.",
     "urls": [
      "https://www.justice.gov/usao-edpa/pr/msc-gayane-crew-member-sentenced-5-years-conspiracy-smuggle-1-billion-worth-cocaine",
